# Commit-message scratch files. Never content -- an agent writes one, passes it
# to `git commit -F`, and deletes it. One escaped into a commit on 2026-08-07
# because scripts/flush.ps1 runs `git add -A` on a schedule and does not know
# the difference. Ignored so the automatic flush cannot pick one up again.
_msg.txt
